### 1. Create a campaign (Demo account)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic bWU6MTIz

{
  "title": "Flood Relief Campaign",
  "description": "Providing food, clean water and essential supplies to flood-affected families.",
  "location": "Maharashtra, India",
  "targetAmount": 500000.00,
  "amountRaised": 0.00,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### 2. Get all campaigns (Demo account)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign
Authorization: Basic bWU6MTIz


### 3. Get campaign by ID (Demo account)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/1
Authorization: Basic bWU6MTIz


### 4. Get campaign count (Demo account)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/count
Authorization: Basic bWU6MTIz


### 5. Admin: Get all campaigns
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=


### 6. NGO: Get campaigns
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign
Authorization: Basic bmdvOm5nbzEyMw==


### 7. NGO: Create campaign
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaign
Authorization: Basic bmdvOm5nbzEyMw==
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "NGO Food Distribution",
  "description": "Food distribution for affected families.",
  "location": "Nagpur, Maharashtra",
  "targetAmount": 200000,
  "amountRaised": 0,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### 8. NGO: Update own campaign
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/10
Authorization: Basic bmdvOm5nbzEyMw==
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated NGO Food Distribution",
  "description": "Updated campaign description",
  "location": "Nagpur",
  "targetAmount": 250000,
  "amountRaised": 50000,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 9. NGO: Delete own campaign
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/10
Authorization: Basic bmdvOm5nbzEyMw==


### 10. Demo: Create campaign for ownership test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaign
Authorization: Basic bWU6MTIz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ownership Protection Test",
  "description": "Testing campaign ownership security.",
  "location": "Pune",
  "targetAmount": 100000,
  "amountRaised": 0,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### 11. NGO: Try updating another user's campaign
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/11
Authorization: Basic bmdvOm5nbzEyMw==
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Update Attempt",
  "description": "This update should be blocked.",
  "location": "Pune",
  "targetAmount": 200000,
  "amountRaised": 0,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### 12. NGO: Try deleting another user's campaign
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/11
Authorization: Basic bmdvOm5nbzEyMw==


