### Search campaigns by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/search?title=Campaign
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### Search campaigns by location
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/search?location=Pune
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### Filter active campaigns
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/search?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### Search by title and location
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/search?title=Campaign&location=Pune
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

